4. Execushares Beamer theme
---------------------------
The file templates/execushares/beamerthemeExecushares.sty comes from:

    Beamer-Theme-Execushares
    Author : Kenton Hamaluik
    Source : https://github.com/hamaluik/Beamer-Theme-Execushares
    License: MIT
    Copyright (c) 2014 Kenton Hamaluik

The original license text is shipped at templates/execushares/LICENSE.

TeXDeck's only modification to Execushares: the upstream theme loaded fonts with
\setmainfont{Source Serif Pro} (and similar) by system font name. On machines
where those fonts are not registered with the OS fontconfig, compilation fails.
TeXDeck changed the loads to fontspec Extension / UprightFont style file-name
lookups for SourceSerifPro / SourceSansPro / SourceCodePro so the theme compiles
on a standard TeX Live install. The font files themselves are not distributed
with this repository (they ship with TeX Live).


5. Brand assets; no third-party marks
-------------------------------------
This repository does not contain any trademarks or logos of third-party
institutions. Image files shipped under templates/*/src/brand/ are neutral,
programmatically generated placeholders created for TeXDeck. They are intended
for end users to replace with their own brand assets (same file names).

End users who need branded output must supply their own logo and background
images by replacing the files in src/brand/ (see templates/README.md).
